  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  note: 'The UI Manager manages the UI screens (View base class) using an event channel
    paired with each View. A stack maintains a history of previously shown screens,
    so the UI Manager can "go back" until it reaches the default UI screen, the home
    screen.


    To add a View to the UIManager, pair it with event channel in the
    DisplayViewOnEvent List. '
